      "data": {
        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\naudit_summary.py - Summarize federated-login audit events\nclaims_moderation.py - Moderate free-text claims or notes\nconsent_translate.py - Translate identity-provider consent copy\nidentity_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Federated Login Flow\nidentity_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Federated Login Flow\nlogin_audit_store.py - Persist federated-login audit records in a managed document store\noauth_callback.py - handles the callback and exchanges an authorization code for tokens\npkce_login.py - implements a PKCE login flow for public clients\nprofile_claims.py - fetches and normalizes federated user profile claims\nstart_oauth_login.py - starts an OAuth or OIDC authorization-code login\n\nCreate start_oauth_login.py in the current working directory.\nTask: starts an OAuth or OIDC authorization-code login.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
